 "<b style=\"font-size:25px;color:#e0612b\">Aviso temprano</b><br><span style=\"font-size:20px;color:#16202e\">Si se hubiera visto en T2, había margen.</span>": "<b style=\"font-size:25px;color:#e0612b\">Early warning</b><br><span style=\"font-size:20px;color:#16202e\">If it had been spotted in Q2, there was room to act.</span>",
 "Lo peor es no hacer nada o esperar al cierre del año.": "The worst thing is to do nothing or to wait until year-end.",
 "Qué hacer con una desviación": "What to do about a variance",
